const newBatch25=[["Which connective tissue sheath surrounds an individual muscle fibre?","एउटा muscle fibre लाई घेर्ने connective tissue sheath कुन हो?",["Endomysium","Perimysium","Epimysium","Fascia lata"],0,"Endomysium surrounds each muscle fibre; perimysium surrounds a fascicle and epimysium surrounds the whole muscle.","Endomysium ले प्रत्येक muscle fibre घेर्छ; perimysium ले fascicle र epimysium ले पूरै muscle घेर्छ।","Section 1"],["Which joint type permits movement in several directions, including rotation?","Rotation सहित धेरै दिशामा चाल हुने joint कुन प्रकारको हो?",["Ball-and-socket joint","Hinge joint","Pivot joint","Plane joint"],0,"Ball-and-socket joints permit movement in multiple directions, including rotation.","Ball-and-socket joint ले rotation सहित धेरै दिशामा चाल गर्न दिन्छ।","Section 1"],["The structural and functional unit of the nervous system is the:","स्नायु प्रणालीको संरचनात्मक तथा कार्यात्मक एकाइ कुन हो?",["Neuron","Nephron","Sarcomere","Alveolus"],0,"A neuron receives and transmits nerve signals.","Neuron ले स्नायु संकेत ग्रहण र प्रसारण गर्छ।","Section 1"],["Which protein stores oxygen inside skeletal muscle?","Skeletal muscle भित्र अक्सिजन भण्डारण गर्ने protein कुन हो?",["Myoglobin","Albumin","Fibrinogen","Keratin"],0,"Myoglobin binds oxygen in muscle and supports oxygen availability during activity.","Myoglobin ले muscle मा अक्सिजन बाँधेर activity का बेला उपलब्धतामा सहयोग गर्छ।","Section 1"],["Which blood component is most directly involved in primary haemostasis?","Primary haemostasis मा प्रत्यक्ष भूमिका खेल्ने blood component कुन हो?",["Platelets","Erythrocytes","Albumin","Neutrophils"],0,"Platelets adhere and aggregate at an injury site to form the initial platelet plug.","Platelet चोट लागेको ठाउँमा टाँसिएर जम्मा भई प्रारम्भिक platelet plug बनाउँछन्।","Section 1"],["Which hormone promotes cellular glucose uptake and lowers blood glucose?","कोशिकाले glucose ग्रहण गर्न सहयोग गरी blood glucose घटाउने hormone कुन हो?",["Insulin","Glucagon","Cortisol","Adrenaline"],0,"Insulin promotes glucose uptake in several tissues and lowers blood glucose.","Insulin ले विभिन्न tissue मा glucose uptake बढाएर blood glucose घटाउँछ।","Section 1"],["Which condition is associated with reduced bone mass and increased fragility-fracture risk?","हड्डीको mass घटेर fragility fracture को जोखिम बढ्ने अवस्था कुन हो?",["Osteoporosis","Osteomyelitis","Osteoarthritis","Scoliosis"],0,"Osteoporosis reduces bone strength and increases fracture risk.","Osteoporosis मा हड्डी कमजोर भई fracture हुने जोखिम बढ्छ।","Section 1"],["Which adverse effect is a recognized concern with prolonged NSAID use?","लामो समय NSAID प्रयोग गर्दा कुन adverse effect को जोखिम हुन्छ?",["Gastrointestinal ulceration or bleeding","Permanent increase in bone density","Improved kidney function","Prevention of all infections"],0,"NSAIDs can injure gastrointestinal mucosa and increase ulcer or bleeding risk; renal risks also matter.","NSAID ले पेटको mucosa मा असर गरी ulcer वा bleeding को जोखिम बढाउन सक्छ; मिर्गौलाको जोखिम पनि विचार गर्नुपर्छ।","Section 1"],["Which mineral is a major component of bone hydroxyapatite?","हड्डीको hydroxyapatite को मुख्य mineral कुन हो?",["Calcium","Sodium","Chloride","Iron"],0,"Hydroxyapatite is a calcium-phosphate mineral that provides bone hardness.","Hydroxyapatite calcium-phosphate mineral हो, जसले हड्डीलाई कडापन दिन्छ।","Section 1"],["What does the duty cycle of pulsed ultrasound describe?","Pulsed ultrasound को duty cycle ले के जनाउँछ?",["The proportion of time ultrasound is on during each cycle","The patient's pulse rate","The treatment room size","The number of electrodes used"],0,"Duty cycle is the percentage of each pulse cycle during which ultrasound energy is delivered.","Duty cycle भनेको प्रत्येक pulse cycle मा ultrasound energy दिइने समयको प्रतिशत हो।","Section 2"],["Which modality uses electromagnetic energy at short-wave frequencies?","Short-wave frequency को electromagnetic energy प्रयोग गर्ने modality कुन हो?",["Shortwave diathermy","TENS","Paraffin wax","Manual massage"],0,"Shortwave diathermy uses electromagnetic energy to produce therapeutic effects in tissues.","Shortwave diathermy ले electromagnetic energy प्रयोग गरी tissue मा therapeutic प्रभाव दिन्छ।","Section 2"],["In a second-class lever, the load is positioned:","Second-class lever मा load कहाँ हुन्छ?",["Between the fulcrum and the effort","Between two efforts","At the same point as the fulcrum","Outside the lever system"],0,"In a second-class lever, resistance lies between fulcrum and effort; a wheelbarrow is a common example.","Second-class lever मा resistance, fulcrum र effort बीचमा हुन्छ; wheelbarrow यसको उदाहरण हो।","Section 2"],["Movement away from the body's midline is called:","शरीरको मध्यरेखाबाट टाढा जाने चाललाई के भनिन्छ?",["Abduction","Adduction","Flexion","Extension"],0,"Abduction moves a limb away from the body's midline.","Abduction भनेको शरीरको मध्यरेखाबाट अङ्ग टाढा लैजाने चाल हो।","Section 2"],["Which muscle contraction occurs while an active muscle lengthens against a load?","Load को प्रतिरोध गर्दा सक्रिय muscle लम्बिने contraction कुन हो?",["Eccentric contraction","Concentric contraction","Isometric contraction","Passive relaxation"],0,"During eccentric contraction, an active muscle lengthens while resisting an external force.","Eccentric contraction मा सक्रिय muscle बाह्य बलको प्रतिरोध गर्दै लम्बिन्छ।","Section 2"],["Which walking aid usually provides a broad base of support?","सामान्य walking aid मध्ये कुनले फराकिलो support base दिन्छ?",["Walking frame","Single-point cane","One crutch","No aid"],0,"A walking frame usually provides a broad base, although selection depends on assessment.","Walking frame ले सामान्यतया फराकिलो support base दिन्छ, तर aid मूल्याङ्कनअनुसार छानिन्छ।","Section 2"],["Which test is commonly used to measure gait speed over a short distance?","छोटो दूरीमा gait speed मापन गर्न कुन test प्रयोग हुन्छ?",["10-Metre Walk Test","Snellen chart","Apgar score","Peak flow test"],0,"The 10-Metre Walk Test measures walking speed over a defined distance.","10-Metre Walk Test ले निश्चित दूरीमा हिँड्ने गति मापन गर्छ।","Section 2"],["Which finding may indicate acute compartment syndrome after limb trauma?","अङ्गमा चोटपछि acute compartment syndrome को संकेत कुन हुन सक्छ?",["Severe pain out of proportion, especially on passive stretch","Mild itch at an old scar","Painless stable swelling for years","Normal movement without pain"],0,"Disproportionate pain, pain on passive stretch and evolving neurovascular signs require emergency assessment.","अत्यधिक दुखाइ, passive stretch गर्दा दुखाइ र neurovascular संकेत परिवर्तन भए emergency assessment चाहिन्छ।","Section 3"],["Which condition is an infection involving bone?","हड्डीमा हुने संक्रमणलाई के भनिन्छ?",["Osteomyelitis","Osteoporosis","Osteoarthritis","Osteomalacia"],0,"Osteomyelitis is an infection involving bone and may require medical and antimicrobial management.","Osteomyelitis हड्डीमा हुने संक्रमण हो र medical तथा antimicrobial उपचार आवश्यक पर्न सक्छ।","Section 3"],["Partial loss of normal contact between joint surfaces is called:","जोर्नीका सतहबीचको सामान्य सम्पर्क आंशिक रूपमा हराउनुलाई के भनिन्छ?",["Subluxation","Complete dislocation","Ankylosis","Contracture"],0,"Subluxation is partial loss of normal alignment or contact between joint surfaces.","Subluxation भनेको जोर्नीका सतहबीचको सामान्य alignment वा सम्पर्क आंशिक रूपमा हराउनु हो।","Section 3"],["Which spinal deformity describes an excessive posterior convex curve in the thoracic region?","Thoracic क्षेत्रमा पछाडितर्फको convex curve अत्यधिक हुनु कुन deformity हो?",["Kyphosis","Lordosis","Scoliosis","Spondylolysis"],0,"Kyphosis is an increased posterior convex curvature, commonly described in the thoracic spine.","Kyphosis भनेको विशेषगरी thoracic spine मा पछाडितर्फको convex curvature बढ्नु हो।","Section 3"],["Which intervention helps prevent pressure injury in a person with limited mobility?","चल्न नसक्ने व्यक्तिमा pressure injury रोक्न कुन उपाय उपयोगी हुन्छ?",["Regular repositioning and skin inspection","Keeping one position all day","Forceful massage over reddened areas","Restricting all fluids"],0,"Individualized repositioning, skin checks and pressure redistribution help prevent pressure injury.","व्यक्तिअनुसार position परिवर्तन, छाला जाँच र pressure redistribution ले pressure injury रोक्न सहयोग गर्छ।","Section 3"],["Which scale assesses eye, verbal and motor responses after traumatic brain injury?","Traumatic brain injury पछि eye, verbal र motor response जाँच्ने scale कुन हो?",["Glasgow Coma Scale","Berg Balance Scale","House-Brackmann scale","Tanner scale"],0,"The Glasgow Coma Scale assesses eye, verbal and motor responses.","Glasgow Coma Scale ले eye, verbal र motor response मूल्याङ्कन गर्छ।","Section 4"],["Which precaution is important for a patient with active pulmonary tuberculosis?","सक्रिय pulmonary tuberculosis भएको बिरामीका लागि कुन सावधानी महत्त्वपूर्ण हुन्छ?",["Follow airborne infection-control precautions","Use no respiratory precautions","Share unclean equipment","Ignore cough and fever"],0,"Pulmonary TB requires appropriate airborne precautions and infection-control procedures according to local policy.","Pulmonary TB मा स्थानीय नीतिअनुसार airborne precaution र infection-control प्रक्रिया अपनाउनुपर्छ।","Section 4"],["Which congenital condition may cause persistent head tilt due to sternocleidomastoid shortening?","Sternocleidomastoid छोटो हुँदा लगातार टाउको ढल्किने congenital अवस्था कुन हो?",["Congenital muscular torticollis","Cerebral palsy","Hydrocephalus","Spina bifida"],0,"Congenital muscular torticollis may cause head tilt and rotation due to unilateral sternocleidomastoid shortening.","Congenital muscular torticollis मा एकातर्फको sternocleidomastoid छोटो हुँदा टाउको ढल्किन र घुम्न सक्छ।","Section 4"],["Which developmental domain includes sitting, crawling, standing and walking?","बस्ने, घस्रिने, उभिने र हिँड्ने कुन developmental domain मा पर्छ?",["Gross motor development","Fine motor development","Language development","Social communication only"],0,"Gross motor development involves large-muscle activities such as posture, locomotion and balance.","Gross motor development मा posture, हिँडडुल र balance जस्ता ठूला मांसपेशीका गतिविधि पर्छन्।","Section 4"]];
