 ["Which term means movement toward the body's midline?","शरीरको midline तर्फ movement लाई के भनिन्छ?",["Adduction","Abduction","External rotation","Dorsiflexion"],0,"Adduction moves a segment toward the midline.","Adduction ले segment लाई midline तर्फ ल्याउँछ।","Section 1"],
 ["What is the main goal of pulmonary rehabilitation?","Pulmonary rehabilitation को मुख्य लक्ष्य के हो?",["Improve exercise capacity, symptoms, function and quality of life","Cure every chronic lung disease permanently","Replace all prescribed medicines","Avoid all physical activity"],0,"Pulmonary rehabilitation combines individualized exercise, education and self-management support.","Pulmonary rehabilitation मा individualized exercise, education र self-management support हुन्छ।","Section 4"]
